      "body": "**Thank you for this**, I used to spend hours making reroutes and aligning and grouping them about a year ago dnd while we've come a long way, and this is the closest Ive seen to how I like to set up my flows. \n\n**For those reading** -  If you are having **trouble making ribbons** and you use the old style reroutes... - use the new circle style; if you just search reroute in the canvas if will pull up the older version. ",
